'''Plasmablade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Plasmablade Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Plasma Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the gamepasses have since went offsale.

==Appearance==
The blade is leaf shaped with three small indents on each side in the shape of semicircles. The blade is entirely filled with liquid plasma that starts in a pink color by the tip, which then fades to a purplish blue in the center, and finally fades into a turquoise along the silver guard and side guard. The guard wraps underneath the blade and beside the handle, forming the side guard. Clipped to the ricasso of the blade is the silver hexagon shaped guard part that has a black center with a diamond-cut pattern over it. Wrapped around the hexagon guard part is the silver circular quillon block. The handle, attached below the quillon block, is black with the pommel below it being made out of the side guard.

==Trivia ==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Plasmabeam]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Plasma_Set Plasma Set].
*This and its partner gun are the second gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the first being [[Iceflake]] and [[Icebeam]]. Future gamepass weapons that had this option were [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]] and [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*IDontHaveAUse teased the release of this knife as Carrotblade as an April Fools joke on his Twitter.
**The tweet can be found [https://mobile.twitter.com/ID0ntHaveAUse/status/1509956610919223305 here].
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/10014680882/ElectricKnife here].

